.TH DANBY-MERCURYROTATION 1
.SH NAME
danby-mercuryrotation \- Mercury's 3:2 spin-orbit resonance
.SH DESCRIPTION
The model combines Mercury's eccentric orbit, permanent triaxial torque, and
weak tidal friction.  Its resonant observable is twice the body angle minus
three times the orbital anomaly; bounded motion indicates 3:2 capture.
